# Pairs with SinkChainIntact. The pass deletes a doomed base's sink manifest
# before that of a doomed increment built on it, so until the increment's
# manifest goes - forever, if the pass is interrupted - the sink holds a
# published increment whose base is gone.
MODULE: SinkChainIntactBaseDeletedFirst
TARGET: SinkChainIntact
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a base's sink manifest is deleted before its doomed increment's
PERTURBS: DelMan

--- FIND
    /\ ~BuiltOn(m, snk \cap prDoomed[p])
--- REPLACE
    \* MUTATION: no tip-first order.
    /\ TRUE
--- END